WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.925
Year by year the planes spread all the way round.

00:03.418 --> 00:14.194
By January 2013 the cloud is a shell round the Earth: 3 378 pieces catalogued, 3 076 still in orbit.

00:14.714 --> 00:16.274
Satellites have to dodge them.

00:16.751 --> 00:21.956
The International Space Station moved out of the way of one in January 2012.
